{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-13","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与平面与平行线","englishTitle":"If a cylinder be cut by a plane which is parallel to its opposite planes, then, as the cylinder is to the cylinder, so will the axis be to the axis.","book":12,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","contentId":"euclid-12-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1553154f6ca7d782b5efc0bf07230718a87ce23ab08ba857f923df775298225","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-13.statement","euclid-12-13.construction.1","euclid-12-13.construction.2","euclid-12-13.construction.3","euclid-12-13.proof.1","euclid-12-13.proof.2","euclid-12-13.proof.3","euclid-12-13.proof.4","euclid-12-13.proof.5","euclid-12-13.proof.6","euclid-12-13.conclusion","euclid-12-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"117a887d97d4cd6ed9fe2f9f45fcbb0dfbcec1915c96edea82cb5fdb359e45f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cylinder be cut by a plane which is parallel to its opposite planes, then, as the cylinder is to the cylinder, so will the axis be to the axis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个圆柱被一个平面的截断,与它的对面平面平行,那么,圆柱是圆柱的,轴也是轴的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d40ff7f4b4ab1c146052905237aedcc47928faa30002038cbcf94f3f69f56d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cylinder AD be cut by the plane GH which is parallel to the opposite planes AB, CD, and let the plane GH meet the axis at the point K; I say that, as the cylinder BG is to the cylinder GD, so is the axis EK to the axis KF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AD气瓶切除为平面 GH,与平面 AB对齐,CD,让平面 GH气瓶相交到K轴上;我说,BG气瓶与GD气瓶的比等于EK气瓶与KF气瓶的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"022aea17db1a9d917f125d90b08f621681e00d53dbce92482c4a11675b10a07e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the axis EF be produced in both directions to the points L, M, and let there be set out any number whatever of axes EN, NL equal to the axis EK, and any number whatever FO, OM equal to FK; and let the cylinder PW on the axis LM be conceived of which the circles PQ, VW are the bases."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将EF轴双向延伸至L、M点,并列出任何数量,不论轴数EN、NL等于轴数EK,也不论数字FO、OM等于FK;使轴数LM上的圆PW圆圈PQ、VW是底边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e009e25f50cbab79f5bc798a9c47568e13778d2a0e24d4592d0a9de40dba8489","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let planes be carried through the points N, O parallel to AB, CD and to the bases of the cylinder PW, and let them produce the circles RS, TU about the centres N, O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平面从N、O、AB、CD和PW气瓶的底边两侧运过,并让它们把RS、TU各中心圈子扩大到N、O。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ea2a6d6ab978cfd632d70bca51fb71d5b9e876a550c69630bdeba5dcc1feedc","citations":["euclid-12-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the axes LN, NE, EK are equal to one another, therefore the cylinders QR, RB, BG are to one another as their bases. [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于轴LN,NE,EK是等同的,因此,QR,RB,BG气瓶是作为底边气瓶相互的。 [[XII. 11](/principles/euclid-12-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bac3a5e964a5a67ba912c5acf2fef30cf02705a8b4e57f26d121443dc476720","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the bases are equal; therefore the cylinders QR, RB, BG are also equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是底边是等量的,因此QR、RB、BG气瓶也是等量的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"325330704634d03f293b0fa0e187ef6e388292a8fceae40bc9b04fe04e9f0d97","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the axes LN, NE, EK are equal to one another, and the cylinders QR, RB, BG are also equal to one another, and the multitude of the former is equal to the multitude of the latter, therefore, whatever multiple the axis KL is of the axis EK, the same multiple also will the cylinder QG be of the cylinder GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,轴LN,NE,EK是等同的,圆柱QR,RB,BG也是等同的,而圆柱的数量与圆轴的数量相等,因此,无论轴KL是轴EK的倍数,圆柱QG也是GB的倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d2d6e824b7925b775e54e2cfbfabe554cc881d04ce7a095606cdbb29adc922b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, whatever multiple the axis MK is of the axis KF, the same multiple also is the cylinder WG of the cylinder GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,无论轴MK的倍数是轴KF, 圆瓶WG也是相同的倍数。（相关点与线段：GD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d893b33c99f6d0c807006726e63c6e2c909997b73db48374428701fdcf4ddb77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the axis KL is equal to the axis KM, the cylinder QG will also be equal to the cylinder GW, if the axis is greater than the axis, the cylinder will also be greater than the cylinder, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果轴KL等于轴KM,圆柱QG也等于圆柱GW,如果轴大于轴,圆柱也大于圆柱,如果小于,则小于。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af1afa4fd0465b90e7436324ddad027061db0b8ece427e7e60d9e37a3dd454a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus, there being four magnitudes, the axes EK, KF and the cylinders BG, GD, there have been taken equimultiples of the axis EK and of the cylinder BG, namely the axis LK and the cylinder QG, and equimultiples of the axis KF and of the cylinder GD, namely the axis KM and the cylinder GW; and it has been proved that, if the axis KL is in excess of the axis KM, the cylinder QG is also in excess of the cylinder GW, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,轴EK、KF和气瓶BG有四个等号,轴EK和气瓶BG有同倍数个,即轴LK和气瓶QG有同倍数个,轴KF和气瓶GD有同倍数个,即轴KM和气瓶GW有GW有个;事实证明,如果轴KL超过轴KM,气瓶QG也有GW以上,如果等值、等值、低,甚至少一些。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76c05d6af180b67f999836f26252d13132623fd7b8a72894579a98613540df26","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the axis EK is to the axis KF, so is the cylinder BG to the cylinder GD. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,轴EK与轴KF之比等于圆筒BG与圆筒GD之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-13.source","contentId":"euclid-12-13","revisionId":"euclid-12-13@raw-e1553154f6ca7d78","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47ea2d55fa24fbba009620dae4556a69a6113601dbee68da36ce34921a02c91e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-13:euclid-12-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-13.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"XII. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-13:euclid-5-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-13.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"V. Def. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-14.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"XII. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-15.proof.9","euclid-12-15.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XII. 13"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-13:euclid-12-11:explicit","id":"euclid-12-11","book":12,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：圆柱与圆锥","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-13:euclid-5-def-5:explicit","id":"euclid-5-def-5","book":5,"number":5,"kind":"definition","title":"欧多克索斯比例定义：任意等倍数的比较","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-14:euclid-12-13:explicit","id":"euclid-12-14","book":12,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：圆柱与圆锥","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-15:euclid-12-13:explicit","id":"euclid-12-15","book":12,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：圆柱与圆锥与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
